{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>牛若抵触了儿子或抵触了女儿。</b>因为在段落开头提到了「<span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">וכי</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">יגח</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">שור</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">את</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">איש</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">או</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">את</span> <span lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">אשה</span>」——这暗示的是成年人，所以此处提到，即使抵触的是儿童，也要对它施行同样的审判：牛当被石头打死，其主人也当被天上之手处死。"], :book "exodus", :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 21, :timestamp "2026-07-30T19:03:52.815269485Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}